The dish is a stainless steel bowl, probably about 25-30 cm across at the rim, since the photo shows it filling most of the frame. The carrots form a small pile roughly 12 cm wide and 10 cm long, with a thin layer of shreds. I estimate about 60 g of shredded carrot. Carrot has about 41 kcal per 100 g, so 60 g is roughly 25 kcal.

The pile could be a bit larger than that, so I'll go with 70 g and 30 kcal.

